# A structure that is an INPUT to the figure rather than its subject -- the
# backbone entering the policy in the Figure 1 schematic. It keeps the normal
# outline so it still reads as a fold, and drops to a single light grey so it
# cannot compete with the fragment colours beside it.
#
# ray_trace_mode 2 (pure line art, no fill) was tried first and is too faint at
# the size this is used -- it reads as a pencil sketch, not a protein. Kept as
# a note rather than a setting.
set cartoon_loop_radius, 0.45
